# Dxun, back from Iziz to the Ebon Hawk (TSL, 403DXN, 401DXN, 003EBO):
# Mandalore's word at the shuttle (mand_cs2: he travels with the Exile to
# gather the clans; asked about Clan Ordo and where the other clans are),
# Atton's word that the Hawk is patched up, Kelborn left in charge in
# Mandalore's room (he will send word when Onderon changes), the
# Mandalorian guide back to the landing, and aboard the Ebon Hawk: the
# first visit to Onderon done, Korriban next.
# Starts from the return's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dxun_return data/routes/tsl/dxun_return.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Dxun, Finale (For Now)"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: Mandalore's back room (locked_door: three boxes, MilHighMetalBox,
# MilMidMetalBox@1 and @3, and CivilBagStrap@3; DSimpson says it may be
# searched now), the assassins' remains about the camp.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - Mandalore (NPC 2) a companion from here on (a_set_return), Mira in
#   the party.
# - UNSURE: mand_cs2 starts by itself as the shuttle lands (k_403_enter,
#   502OND_End_First set) and Atton's part (a_atton_mandcs2,
#   a_destroy_atton) plays out in it.
# - UNSURE: Kelborn is spawned in Mandalore's room as npc_kelborn (the
#   403DXN template's tag, not 402DXN's "kelborn"); his start 1
#   (c_post_403) asks no reply.
# - The guide (man_guide, manguide.dlg) takes the party to 401DXN
#   (a_guide2_camp); the Hawk's own ramp trigger (to_ebonhawk) takes it
#   aboard. Kelborn's message to return comes later (the finale).
say Isn't Clan Ordo enough for you? # Mandalore (mand_cs2)
say Where are the other clans?
talk
use npc_kelborn      # Kelborn in charge (start 1)
talk
say =Let's go.       # the Mandalorian guide
use man_guide
talk
module 401dxn
to to_ebonhawk       # aboard
module 003ebo
save onderon_first_done
